  "articleBody": "A backyard cottage is usually planned as a detached accessory dwelling unit (ADU) with its own living, sleeping, cooking, and sanitation facilities. Before hiring a remodeling provider, confirm the property’s jurisdiction, lot conditions, utility connections, coastal or fire-zone constraints, desired use, and whether a detached build or garage conversion better fits the site and budget.",
